<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have withdrawn from near Bunia after heavy clashes but opened a new front near the Uganda border and are advancing on Uvira city. WHO evacuated its Ebola response team from an Ituri hospital after they were trapped by fighting, and the Ebola death rate is now near 50%. A Congolese military aircraft went missing after rebels claimed to have shot it down, leading to the capture of a South African mercenary. Kenya and the DRC have agreed to restore diplomatic ties following recent tensions. The conflict has displaced 8.2 million people, according to DNE Africa, and there were 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQWTZXWDF3TWQxMnpmcmY3djFMVzVoYXRZa2xic21XLWR3SnZFZ19uLXJJelJwR1lVQVh6WV9UVkFlRThndkF3UlFOUVNyRzVoUV9KOEw2UTZYR0NWc0xBeUFlQlZKQmMtd2YySXJVd0E1cXpDLVRLN2RVSzhINDZsYzBqX2Vxd3NBRWotQlE0dHpGd1pWdk1zb2Z0cE5CUXRuMnNaZWpYWVlpOThKT3dvOEQ4R0JmaVp2TmJPVlVxNHNlZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQWDdrcllEUWhscEtTb1k0WGVQOGhsZGJGbjY5VS1IM004VUNlVnpheFlFNGFfU0pFZlg5TjRNRi1ib3IyVzNrRDBoczk2cWhtaTZvTXJ5LTVqZldLVGFfaWVGRWY1VXM5b0tjQUp2VnRUNTQ0T0lPa05EUTNGZC1kRXIyWDdRTC0tOVNXa2c5aDQzamE5ZHp2OFY5RDQwUnRtT01PUWlicWNFNEw2SENBc0NKb09VeC1Y0gG-AUFVX3lxTE5peTRoS1NQY2hRWktSV19HczN1WmRQaXZ4UEVUN21ZNHQ3ZkFfbUdJYW14dC10YWVqQ3dyTHMzODJsRnkweG1RbWZNMXg4ejd6T2NFeXJGaWlwSWdsS0hPYjB2LTVlVmtIWTY4MFlOdHEtMjFYV1gxeVRCOXY1TWJzbHhHV1VzcG9tS1dvVHNNTExJcmpvbEZpQWZmQzZCSEpLSkNoRlktT3h2MEEyU0VUSHR6cDNVb3BlMjRpT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5QVDc3MUtCdWYxdVdmUnhmeTlyRmVyaERfOVJWZllSbVZYQzEydEdaYWRaNjdpb05WRzdNSTZ2UmFxMDZONm1wRUEwN2pNdnhCT19LRDQzdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/